# Round 25 (23:35 ET): concept panel group 3. Cubbat PASS (8.5/8.3/8.7). Edits + 3 new looks.
TA('Cubbat',CO+'c_cubbat_2.jpg')
CQ('Pipwom',CO+'c_cubbat_2.jpg')
CE('Cetorgan',2,"thicken the organ pipes and root their base in the skin around the blowhole so the pipe fan grows out of the head, make the pipes rise out of the flanks too, give it a glowing eye and a grander arched swimming pose.")
CE('Lurklet',3,"turn the lure into a small round flat steel trigger-plate disc with a faint violet glow, move small worried bead eyes higher on the head with raised brows, and make the expression a wide, nervous, sheepish clenched trap grin instead of a fully open maw.")
CE('Mumblet',1,"replace the crab pincers with broad flat spade-like cicada digging forelegs, shorten the front grille plate so the head pokes out below it as its own round shape, and give it a cicada-nymph face with big bulging eyes shut tight (no human nose or lips).")
CE('Pawnfry',2,"tilt the body into a bobbing lean, make the round weighted base clearly the tail tip curled into a coil (no separate pedestal), and replace the gold ring with a thin gold grain line painted into the wood.")
CE('Polyshroom',2,"make the cap a translucent jellyfish bell with a soft inner glow and a faint frilly rim, put two small drowsy eyes on short stalk bumps near the top of the stalk, and add faint purple-black gill lines under the cap rim.")
CE('Rattlebub',1,"thicken the join between the tail and the maraca bulb so it flows smoothly into the gourd, and turn the body bands into painted dotted diamond patterns (no ring bands).")
CE('Scoopsy',3,"remove any waffle cup underneath, and give the wafer-patterned tail a visible tapered tip that wraps up over its front paws so it can only read as a tail; make the head rounder with big round dormouse ears.")
CE('Gravigrub',2,"remove the little arms and blend the cratered moon into the grub's underside so the cream body curls around and merges into it as its belly.")
CN('Ghoulamari',"A compact vampire squid whose whole rounded mantle IS a clear crystal ball flowing seamlessly into its wine-red flesh (no rim or seam), its only eyes two huge deadpan silver eyes floating inside the silver mist in the ball, sitting on a bell-shaped cloak of eight thick arms joined by deep wine-red webbing with short soft cirri and silver crescent marks.","thin curly tentacles, an octopus head, a glass bowl worn on the head, extra eyes on the body")
CN('Glacione',"A small translucent sea-angel: a soft rounded gelatinous head with pale cork-textured skin and a tiny face with a hidden fanged smile, two smooth translucent rounded wing-lobes flapping like a shuttlecock's leading feathers, and a lower body that flares into a frosted feather-lobed skirt with a glowing silver crescent at its core.","bird or angel wings, a metal band or ring at the neck, two heads, an object with a face")
CN('Olmlet',"A very long, thin, eel-like baby olm curled into an S like a tiny dragon, with a narrow flat spade-shaped snout, tiny stick legs set far apart, only three small tight porcelain petal-tab gill nubs, glossy white glazed porcelain skin with blush only on the cheeks, and one gold kintsugi crack running down its body as the main accent; a serene blind face.","an axolotl, feathery gill fronds, a pink body, a round axolotl head")
PRIORITY=PRIORITY+['ta_cubbat','c_pipwom']+[s['id'] for s in SPECS if s['id'] in ('c_cetorgan_e','c_lurklet_e','c_mumblet_e','c_pawnfry_e','c_polyshroom_e','c_rattlebub_e','c_scoopsy_e','c_gravigrub_e','c_ghoulamari_r','c_glacione_r','c_olmlet_r')]
